WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.733
[Music] Download, extract, and open
Mcbe2Friends.

00:00:02.733 --> 00:00:05.267
Enter the Bedrock address and port.
Choose Continue.

00:00:05.267 --> 00:00:08.133
Choose Connect & start. Sign in with
Microsoft.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:10.667
Add the Xbox gamertag. Once accepted,
join from Play → Friends.

00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:13.667
Copy your PC code. Buy Premium on
Discord for $15 and activate.

00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:16.500
Accept the terms, start Bedrock, and
allow your friends.

00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.000
Stop the server to enable packs, back
up, or restore a world.
